  "difficulty_reason": "The theorem builds finite-type integer models of an arbitrary qcqs algebraic space through finite Nisnevich filtration, relative scheme approximation and explicit gluing of finite-stage etale equivalence relations. The new relation is manufactured by adjoining the complement diagonal to a descended overlap relation, then cartesian transitions and quotient limits are recovered. This non-schematic approximation/effectiveness construction is substantially beyond routine scheme descent or formal parameter changes.",
